Trepadora {version}
Climbing plant generator for Maya.

Folder: {carpeta}

instalado:
Trepadora is installed.

You will find it in the Trepadora menu and on the Trepadora shelf, and it will load by itself every time you open Maya.

Folder: {carpeta}
Module: {mod}

instalado_sin_plugin:
Trepadora is installed, but Maya could not load its plug-in.

The window and the shelf work. Without the plug-in, the Trepadora menu will not appear when you open Maya again, and Ctrl+Z will not remove a plant made with Create mesh in one go.

If Maya warned you that the plug-in comes from an untrusted folder («Untrusted Plugin Loading») and you pressed Deny, drag instalar.py in again and press Allow. Otherwise, the reason is in the Script Editor (Windows > General Editors > Script Editor).

